<title>CANADA: BANK OF CANADA OVERNIGHT MONEY MARKET FINANCING.</title>
<headline>BANK OF CANADA OVERNIGHT MONEY MARKET FINANCING.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's average overnight  money market financing rate for the week ended July 30 was 3.25 percent,  the Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>(Reuters Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
